{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1064523/block/singleImage/3271423/df/01M7QGEJ1ZMJ26DTH4XMWW3BFM.jpg?updatedAt=1795011901\"/><figcaption>JW與老公王至尊終於肯合照。(娛樂組攝)</figcaption></figure><p>衛蘭(Janice)今日於紅館舉行最後一場《衛蘭OUT OF FRAME世界巡迴演唱會》。JW王灝兒與丈夫王至尊結伴支持，見到大批傳媒時，身高156cm的JW一度以身幫老公擋鏡頭，叫記者只影她，之後經再三邀請，兩老婆才一起合照。其他入場嘉賓還有楊千嬅與老公丁子高、AGA江海迦與未婚夫鄭子邦，以及關心妍、林盛斌、Kiri.T和Nancy Kwai等。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T15:44:17.122066+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":196,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T14:25:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T15:57:26.745230+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T15:37:27.572563+00:00","content_hash":"86d7655c3e98dc88731043d679ec7f4ba2fa44630817285096a2087590e6b36b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T15:44:17.122066+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}